  "id": "Kingston-26_00461_ADV",
  "appeal_status": "Appeal In Progress",
  "appeal_start_date": "22/06/2026",
  "description": "Installation of double sided internally illuminated 75inch LCD display screen on pavement",
  "development_type": "Other advertisements",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed Hub advertisement would have an overly dominant appearance within the street scene and would detract from the walking environment along Kingston Hill and would appear as visual street clutter resulting in an overcrowded appearance, causing harm to the Park Road Conservation Area. The harm would not be outweighed by the public benefits associated with the proposal. As such, the proposal is contrary to Policies: CS8, DM10 and DM12 of the Kingston Core Strategy (2012), Policy D3 of the London Plan (2021) and the NPPF (2024)."
  ],
